# omaishort (Cline / Roo)

Read `AGENTS.md` in the repo root before you edit.

- Rules: `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`
- Skills: `.cursor/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (use the table in AGENTS.md)
- Tests: `pytest -q` after engine/schema; `npx tsc --noEmit` in `apps/web`
- Do not commit `data/`, `.env`, or MP4
- Do not clone MoneyPrinter / OpenMontage / HyperFrames into this tree
